
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= skill.title %> | Nurse Mate</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">

    <style>
        .detail-header {
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .detail-category {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #eaf4ee;
            color: #43866b;
            padding: 6px 13px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .detail-header h2 {
            font-size: 28px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .detail-header p {
            color: #829087;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        .detail-card {
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid #e8eee9;
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 28px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .detail-card h3 {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            color: #326b54;
        }

        .detail-card p {
            color: #526158;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.9;
            white-space: pre-line;
        }

        .back-button {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            color: #43866b;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .complete-area {
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid #e8eee9;
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 25px;
            margin-top: 25px;
        }

        .complete-button {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 15px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 9px;
            background: #43866b;
            color: white;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .complete-button:hover {
            background: #326b54;
        }

        .completed-message {
            color: #43866b;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 12px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="dashboard">

        <aside class="sidebar">
            <h2>Nurse Mate</h2>
            <p>간호학과 학생을 위한 실습 파트너</p>

            <nav>
    <a href="/">대시보드</a>
    <a href="/skills">간호 술기 학습</a>
    <a href="/clinical-logs">임상실습 기록</a>
    <a href="/checklist">학습 체크리스트</a>
    <a href="/practice-schedules">실습 일정 관리</a>
    <a href="/quiz">간호 퀴즈</a>
    <a href="/medical-terms">의학용어 사전</a>
    <a href="/logout">로그아웃</a>
</nav>
        </aside>

        <main class="main-content">

            <header>
                <div>
                    <h1>간호 술기 학습</h1>
                    <p>술기의 핵심 내용을 확인해 보세요.</p>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <span><%= user.name %>님</span>
                    <a href="/logout">로그아웃</a>
                </div>
            </header>

            <a href="/skills" class="back-button">
                ← 술기 목록으로 돌아가기
            </a>

            <section class="detail-header">
                <span class="detail-category">
                    <%= skill.category %>
                </span>

                <h2><%= skill.title %></h2>
                <p><%= skill.description || '등록된 설명이 없습니다.' %></p>
            </section>

            <section class="detail-card">
                <h3>준비물</h3>
                <p><%= skill.supplies || '등록된 준비물이 없습니다.' %></p>
            </section>

            <section class="detail-card">
                <h3>수행 절차</h3>
                <p><%= skill.procedure_text || '등록된 수행 절차가 없습니다.' %></p>
            </section>

            <section class="detail-card">
                <h3>주의사항</h3>
                <p><%= skill.precautions || '등록된 주의사항이 없습니다.' %></p>
            </section>

            <section class="complete-area">
                <% if (completed) { %>
                    <p class="completed-message">
                        ✓ 학습 완료한 술기입니다!
                    </p>
                <% } else { %>
                    <form action="/skills/<%= skill.id %>/complete" method="POST">
                        <button type="submit" class="complete-button">
                            학습 완료하기
                        </button>
                    </form>
                <% } %>
            </section>

        </main>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
